The Oracle Paradox is a composition artifact: pooled over six conversation sets the oracle scores below XG-Guard, but on XG-Guard's own debates the two differ by only -0.06 pp (2 XG-only vs 1 oracle-only debates). Type I/II/III mechanisms therefore explain a handful of debates, not the headline gap.

